      "body": "Closing as complete via PR #326 (merge commit fe6f6fc, on main). DoD verified on origin/main: (1) POST /api/r4g1/generate accepts opt-in include_witness and the response verifies end-to-end against the loaded artifact via the extended POST /api/uor/verify (src/server.rs:3286-3447, crates/uor-r4-api/src/engine.rs::verify_witnesses); (2) tampered witnesses — inflated depth and replaced region κ — are rejected with typed WitnessVerificationError reasons (engine.rs:245-283), asserted in tests/status_policy.rs::proof_witness_roundtrips_and_rejects_tampering; (3) conformance vectors recorded in the same tests-as-vectors convention as the #256/#257 set, with a vector table in docs/proof_carrying_inference_266.md. Runtime kernel and allocation-free hot path unchanged.",
